redits I'm getting from the Void!)\nGRIND.\nGRIND.\nGRIND.\nGRIND.\nGRIND.\nMan, this Limbo is a real cool guy. I wish I was a cool guy like Limbo. (That agile animation set is so JoJo.)\nGRIND.\nGRIND.\nGRIND.\nGRIND.\nGRIND.\nGRIND.\nWhy do I have over 600 hours in this game and why do I still love it? Pleasetorturememorewithyourfakelongevity.\n\nAlso the lore is really interesting for a free-to-play game.", "timestamp_created": 1415400721, "timestamp_updated": 1415400721, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "12835143", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071753835", "personaname": "kraft-zinger", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198071753835/", "num_games_owned": 212, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 19845, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19845, "last_played": 1601169809, "avatar": "703ae4135a92c3092cae0918d86435baf457ff60"}, "language": "english", "review": "being the best multiplayer looter shooter surprisingly did little to stop this game from being the biggest waste of time in my life. this doesn't bode well for the genre. i will always have morphine at least", "timestamp_created": 1415399410, "timestamp_updated": 1624854841, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}